From ceecd263c4e9b3c28cc4a16ac6bbe604908ed178 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 23:16:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/32] Make the accepted capture baseline recoverable from the
 Manager

Align reset behavior, operational budgets, capture points 03/05/41, validation feedback, and advanced defaults so the UI restores one coherent configuration.

Constraint: The top app-bar reset must restore the full Manager baseline while the budget reset remains budget-only.

Rejected: Keep refresh semantics on the top reset icon | It did not restore user-visible defaults.

Confidence: high

Scope-risk: moderate

Directive: Keep Manager, Framework property fallbacks, and ART hard limits synchronized when changing defaults.

Tested: source contract validation; m -j8 R0dumpManager R0dumpManagerTests framework-minus-apex; device instrumentation; userdebug post-flash validation.
